    {
      "id": 8159346786393,
      "title": "Mosaic mirror art",
      "body_html": "<p>Add a bold, avant-garde statement to your space with our Reflective Stallion. This isn’t just wall art; it’s a conversation piece. Each piece is meticulously hand-assembled using shattered mirror fragments to form the powerful silhouette of a horse against a deep, textured midnight-black canvas.</p>\n<p>Because of the mosaic technique, the artwork \"changes\" throughout the day. As the sun moves or your room lights dim, the mirror shards catch the light from different angles, bringing a sense of life and motion to the stallion</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Safety Disclaimer:</b> Since this is \"broken DIY mirror\" art, be sure to include a small note that the edges are sealed (if they are) or that it is intended for decorative display out of reach of children.</p>",
